Description: A comprehensive R framework for healthcare process mining with integrated 
    Large Language Model (LLM) capabilities. Provides tools for clinical pathway 
    discovery, patient journey analysis, sepsis progression modeling, and AI-powered 
    clinical insight generation. Built on the bupaR ecosystem with modern R6 class 
    architecture and httr2 for API integration. Designed for healthcare researchers, 
    clinical informaticists, and process improvement specialists.
